# The authoritative spec-file set: one filename per line, relative to docs/target/.
#
# Both readers of this manifest must implement it identically:
# - strip surrounding whitespace from each line;
# - skip blank lines;
# - skip lines whose first non-whitespace character is '#';
# - every remaining line is a filename that must exist as docs/target/<name>.
#
# Both readers compare the manifest's set against the docs/target/*.md files on
# disk, so a stray .md file in docs/target/ is a failure, not noise. The
# comparison covers *.md only, so any other file in that directory - this
# manifest included - is outside the guard.
